  "question": {
    "text": "$0.1(\\mathrm{M}) \\mathrm{HCI}$ and $0.1(\\mathrm{M}) \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4$ each of volume $2 \\mathrm{ml}$ are mixed and the volume is made up to $6 \\mathrm{ml}$ by adding $2 \\mathrm{ml}$ of $0.01(\\mathrm{~N}) \\mathrm{NaCl}$ solution. The $\\mathrm{pH}$ of the resulting mixture is",
