  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: Mili moles of $\\mathrm{H}^{+}=0.1 \\times 2+0.1 \\times 2 \\times 2=0.6$\nTotal volume in $\\mathrm{ml}=6$\n$$\n\\mathrm{pH}=-\\log _{10}\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]=-\\log \\left(\\frac{0.6}{6}\\right)=-\\log 0.1=1\n$$",
